    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest is a multiplayer first-person shooter with an emphasis on realism. This game has a minimum of casual aspects, you won't see the usual crosshair in the center of the screen, health and ammo counter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/27008e4661de8e073d31ddf428dc7afd.avif?t=1750172678\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everything is done so that the immersion is maximum <br> <br>Artificial intelligence is made at a high level, similar to FEAR, bots hear your movement and react to shooting in their direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/a0dc97ec43e58f08b516c91ddb8d9240.avif?t=1750172678\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two maps have been added to diversify the battle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/910f0fa3184db2cd6fd972d6756e7b02.avif?t=1750172678\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hear bullets whistling over your head, you see smoke coming out of the barrel, which can give you away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/7143d9cdea7fbe80379e56d3767d0d2b.avif?t=1750172678\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several funny mechanics have also been added, which you will see directly by playing this game</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest is a multiplayer first-person shooter with an emphasis on realism. This game has a minimum of casual aspects, you won't see the usual crosshair in the center of the screen, health and ammo counter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/27008e4661de8e073d31ddf428dc7afd.avif?t=1750172678\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everything is done so that the immersion is maximum <br> <br>Artificial intelligence is made at a high level, similar to FEAR, bots hear your movement and react to shooting in their direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/a0dc97ec43e58f08b516c91ddb8d9240.avif?t=1750172678\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two maps have been added to diversify the battle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/910f0fa3184db2cd6fd972d6756e7b02.avif?t=1750172678\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hear bullets whistling over your head, you see smoke coming out of the barrel, which can give you away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642600/extras/7143d9cdea7fbe80379e56d3767d0d2b.avif?t=1750172678\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several funny mechanics have also been added, which you will see directly by playing this game</p>",
